1
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:30,865
Go...

2
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:34,749
save the one you love.

3
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:50,465
Lord, what happened?

4
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:53,796
Rinkham...

5
00:00:57,090 --> 00:01:01,454
Khun Chai Phakdee has taken her.

6
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:04,516
I'll bring her back.

7
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:11,098
Kaew!!

8
00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:13,600
Please look after  him..

9
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:16,072
I won't let anything happen to her.

10
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,760
Let me go!

11
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:12,858
I'm not letting you go.

12
00:02:16,470 --> 00:02:17,745
What are you planning to do?

13
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,345
Exactly what you see.

14
00:02:19,710 --> 00:02:22,203
We've been planning this for a long time.

15
00:02:25,070 --> 00:02:26,967
What a pity...

16
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:29,178
you found out about our plan too soon.

17
00:02:31,330 --> 00:02:33,243
It ruined everything we had prepared.

18
00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:37,949
Do you really think I'll submit to you?

19
00:02:38,310 --> 00:02:39,454
You don't have to.

20
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:42,509
Because you won't live long enough to have that choice, my lady!

21
00:02:46,320 --> 00:02:47,338
First, I'll kill you.

22
00:02:49,454 --> 00:02:51,549
Then we'll join forces and kill your father.

23
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:57,614
After that, this city will be mine to rule.

24
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:02,414
I'll never let your plan succeed!

25
00:03:03,210 --> 00:03:04,865
Do you really think anyone is coming to save you?

26
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:07,600
No one is.

27
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,381
Especially Kaew.

28
00:03:15,290 --> 00:03:17,905
I already sent  my men to deal with her and her family.

29
00:03:18,990 --> 00:03:22,705
Now get out of my way before I carry out my grand plan.

30
00:03:29,270 --> 00:03:30,676
What have you done?

31
00:03:33,338 --> 00:03:35,461
By now, her entire family is probably dead.

32
00:03:36,130 --> 00:03:37,941
You have no one left anymore, Rinkham.

33
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:45,847
Rinkham!

34
00:03:48,814 --> 00:03:50,810
Rinkham!

35
00:03:52,909 --> 00:03:53,672
Kaew!

36
00:04:04,450 --> 00:04:06,327
I thought you said you sent men to kill her!

37
00:04:07,294 --> 00:04:10,218
Useless fool! Looks like I'll have to do it myself.

38
00:04:12,072 --> 00:04:12,836
Follow me!

39
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,690
Don't expect her to survive.

40
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,178
She didn't survive tonight.

41
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:39,694
Rinkham!

42
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:16,145
You can't even handle one woman?

43
00:05:20,230 --> 00:05:21,760
What are you idiots standing around for?

44
00:05:21,832 --> 00:05:22,887
Kill her!

45
00:05:47,650 --> 00:05:48,494
Think you're so tough?

46
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:18,043
You've lost.

47
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:31,992
Hey!

48
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:34,625
Are you asking to die?

49
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:42,530
Let her go...

50
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:44,247
or he dies.

51
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,934
Do you think I care about him?

52
00:06:51,316 --> 00:06:53,310
If he dies, it means nothing to me.

53
00:06:57,310 --> 00:06:58,465
But if she dies...

54
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,432
how would you feel then?

55
00:07:06,150 --> 00:07:07,316
Drop your sword,

56
00:07:08,290 --> 00:07:09,461
or she dies.

57
00:07:14,210 --> 00:07:15,076
Kaew!

58
00:07:15,630 --> 00:07:16,443
Don't!

59
00:07:20,850 --> 00:07:22,312
I don’t want to lose you again.

60
00:07:23,910 --> 00:07:25,243
Neither can I.

61
00:07:32,170 --> 00:07:33,330
Look at the two of you...

62
00:07:35,490 --> 00:07:37,818
So deeply in love that you'd die for each other.

63
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:44,887
How pathetic.

64
00:07:46,429 --> 00:07:48,196
The only pathetic one here is you.

65
00:07:48,620 --> 00:07:50,021
What did you just say?

66
00:07:51,890 --> 00:07:53,629
Do you really think you've beaten me?

67
00:07:55,810 --> 00:07:57,810
You're still in the palm of my hand.

68
00:08:07,476 --> 00:08:09,003
Then kill me.

69
00:08:10,065 --> 00:08:11,636
That would be too easy.

70
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,283
Or are you afraid?

71
00:08:38,060 --> 00:08:41,410
A man like me fears nothing.

72
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,370
Do you remember this?

73
00:09:03,403 --> 00:09:05,400
The poison you used to make my father take.

74
00:09:07,730 --> 00:09:10,109
Now it's your turn.

75
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,872
That poison won't kill me.

76
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,920
It only makes a person weaker... little by little.

77
00:09:26,523 --> 00:09:28,520
That's all I wanted.

78
00:09:29,390 --> 00:09:32,189
Death would be too easy for someone like you.

79
00:09:33,220 --> 00:09:35,098
You'll spend a long time suffering in prison.

80
00:09:48,890 --> 00:09:50,203
You've lost.

81
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,581
You've been defeated... by women like us.

82
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,865
Are you hurt?

83
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:23,520
I thought I was going to lose you.

84
00:10:28,590 --> 00:10:29,650
I'm here.

85
00:10:30,894 --> 00:10:33,360
Promise me you won't ever leave again.

86
00:10:36,070 --> 00:10:39,949
As long as I still draw breath... I'll never leave your side again.
